tatus":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A19332"}]}],"start":41,"end":415}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"According to [[Tersly]], Sheba gave King Solomon a gold mine where many his treasures and tokens of love for Sheba were stored, including the [[Ring]] of [[Tao]], the Legendary Titan of Spirit. {{source|To Be Together}} The entrance was found in a large stone snake known as the \"[[Golden Asp]]\", guarded by the three colossi, [[Ashtoreth]], [[Chemosh]] and [[Milcom]]. {{source|The Golden Asp}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"According to Tersly, Sheba gave King Solomon a gold mine where many his treasures and tokens of love for Sheba were stored, including the Ring of Tao, the Legendary Titan of Spirit. [To Be Together] The entrance was found in a large stone snake known as the \"Golden Asp\", guarded by the three colossi, Ashtoreth, Chemosh and Milcom. [The Golden Asp]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" position=\"center\">\nS1E22_golden_asp.jpg|The Golden Asp\nS1E23_Solomons_mines_1.jpg|Stairs down into the mine\nS1E23_Solomon_and_Sheba.jpg|Room of treasures\nS1E23_Tao_door.jpg|Mural and Entrance to the vault\nS1E23_Tao_chamber.jpg|The Vault and resting place of the [[Ring]] of [[Tao]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:King Solomon's mines]]\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Central Desert, Ethiopia]]","text":"S1E22_golden_asp.jpg|The Golden Asp\nS1E23_Solomons_mines_1.jpg|Stairs down into the mine\nS1E23_Solomon_and_Sheba.jpg|Room of treasures\nS1E23_Tao_door.jpg|Mural and Entrance to the vault\nS1E23_Tao_chamber.jpg|The Vault and resting place of the Ring of Tao"}],"full_text":"King Solomon's mines is a gold mine located in a remote area in the Central desert of Ethiopia given to King Solomon by the Queen of Sheba and the resting place of Tao, the Titan of Spirit. Much of the interior was lavishly decorated with gold and blue decor while the surface entrance was a large Golden Asp.\n\n== History ==\nAccording to Tersly, Sheba gave King Solomon a gold mine where many his treasures and tokens of love for Sheba were stored, including the Ring of Tao, the Legendary Titan of Spirit. [To Be Together] The entrance was found in a large stone snake known as the \"Golden Asp\", guarded by the three colossi, Ashtoreth, Chemosh and Milcom. [The Golden Asp]\n\n==Gallery==\n\nS1E22_golden_asp.jpg|The Golden Asp\nS1E23_Solomons_mines_1.jpg|Stairs down into the mine\nS1E23_Solomon_and_Sheba.jpg|Room of treasures\nS1E23_Tao_door.jpg|Mural and Entrance to the vault\nS1E23_Tao_chamber.jpg|The Vault and resting place of the Ring of Tao","raw_wikitext":"{{for|the mission|King Solomon's Mines}}\n{{infobox location\n| image       = File:S1E23_Solomons_mines_2.jpg\n| type        = Gold mine\n| level       = \n| traps = Arrows<br>[[Curse of the Legendary Titans]]\n| titan = [[Tao]]\n| guard titan = [[Ashtoreth]]<br>[[Chemosh]]<br>[[Milcom]]\n| first = \"[[The Golden Asp]]\"\n| location    = [[Central Desert, Ethiopia]]\n| former = [[King Solomon]] †<br> [[Queen of Sheba]] †\n}}\n'''King Solomon's mines''' is a gold mine located in a remote area in the Central desert of Ethiopia given to [[King Solomon]] by the [[Queen of Sheba]] and the resting place of [[Tao]], the Titan of Spirit. Much of the interior was lavishly decorated with gold and blue decor while the surface entrance was a large [[Golden Asp]].\n\n== History ==\nAccording to [[Tersly]], Sheba gave King Solomon a gold mine where many his treasures and tokens of love for Sheba were stored, including the [[Ring]] of [[Tao]], the Legendary Titan of Spirit. {{source|To Be Together}} The entrance was found in a large stone snake known as the \"[[Golden Asp]]\", guarded by the three colossi, [[Ashtoreth]], [[Chemosh]] and [[Milcom]]. {{source|The Golden Asp}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" position=\"center\">\nS1E22_golden_asp.jpg|The Golden Asp\nS1E23_Solomons_mines_1.jpg|Stairs down into the mine\nS1E23_Solomon_and_Sheba.jpg|Room of treasures\nS1E23_Tao_door.jpg|Mural and Entrance to the vault\nS1E23_Tao_chamber.jpg|The Vault and resting place of the [[Ring]] of [[Tao]]\n</gallery>\n[[Category:King Solomon's mines]]\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Central Desert, Ethiopia]]","categories":["Central Desert, Ethiopia","King Solomon's mines","Locations"],"links":[{"target_title":"Curse of the Legendary Titans","label":"Curse of the Legendary Titans","target_id":"huntik:page:3292","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Curse_of_the_Legendary_Titans","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3292"},{"target_title":"Tao","label":"Tao","target_id":"huntik:page:2421","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tao","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2421"},{"target_title":"Ashtoreth","label":"Ashtoreth","target_id":"huntik:page:3066","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ashtoreth","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3066"},{"target_title":"Chemosh","label":"Chemosh","target_id":"huntik:page:3402","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Chemosh","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3402"},{"target_title":"Milcom","label":"Milcom","target_id":"huntik:page:3426","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Milcom","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3426"},{"target_title":"The Golden Asp","label":"The Golden Asp","target_id":"huntik:page:3940","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Golden_Asp","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3940"},{"target_title":"Central Desert, Ethiopia","label":"Central Desert, Ethiopia","target_id":"huntik:page:11009","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Central_Desert%2C_Ethiopia","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Central%20Desert%2C%20Ethiopia"},{"target_title":"King Solomon","label":"King Solomon","target_id":"huntik:page:19336","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/King_